  "details": "after my main party I have an after party where I open it up to invite+ and more often than not someone always invites someone that either I don't want there or someone else doesn't and if we have them blocked we won't be able to see them there. It would be really handy to have a blacklisting system that would not allow a person on that list to sneak into the party by anyone there at that party.",
